sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as Customer App
    actor Driver as Driver App
    participant API as API Gateway / Backend
    participant Redis as Redis Pub/Sub & Geo
    participant SafetyDesk as Safety Desk Dashboard
    actor Guardian as Guardian Contact

    Customer->>API: POST /v1/trips/book (Speed Ceiling, Guardian Contacts)
    API-->>Driver: Dispatch Trip Request
    Driver->>API: POST /v1/trips/:id/handshake (Selfie + OTP)
    API-->>Customer: Handshake Passed -> IN_TRIP
    API-->>Guardian: SMS/WhatsApp Push: Guardian Link Active

    par Dual-GPS Stream Loop (Every 3s)
        Driver->>API: WSS Stream (GPS_driver, Sensors)
        Customer->>API: WSS Stream (GPS_customer)
        API->>Redis: Compute Spatial Delta (Haversine)
    end

    alt Route Anomaly > 150m for > 60s
        API->>SafetyDesk: Trigger L1 Anomaly Event
        API->>Guardian: Push Alert: Route Deviation Detected
    end

    Customer->>API: Hardware Silent SOS (3x Volume Press)
    API->>SafetyDesk: Trigger L4 Emergency Escalation
    SafetyDesk->>Driver: IVR / Direct Call Attempt (< 3 min SLA)
    SafetyDesk->>API: Release Trip Vault Packet to Dial 112
